    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so when you say the new people are coming in for the \"safety\" and \"amenities,\" do you think the shift in the actual population itself contributes to the neighborhood feeling \"better\" or \"higher quality\" for the city? like, is there a qualitative difference in the vibe or the social atmosphere between the old community and the new one?",
